  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Children are protected - South Sudan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening child protection systems and support work to strengthen response and prevention services as well as systems and mechanisms at local, regional and national levels. Engage with local civil society to advocate for improved national policies and legal measures. Other Partners: Action for Children Development Foundation &#x2013; South Sudan(ACDF-SS), Smile Again Africa Development Organization (SAADO), The Organization for Children Harmony (TOCH)</narrative>
  </description>
